              <string>Choose how the text file writes the onset and the duration of the annotations, as times or as numbers of samples. The onset counts from the start of the recording. For example, an onset 5 minutes after the start is written 300 in seconds, 00:05:00 as a time or 76800 in samples at 256 Hz.</string>
             </property>
